OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric 'unsung hero' steam
OL,4,Alocomotive recreated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wartime steam locomotive that helped
OL,7,Fto keep a region's industry moving for
OL,8,Fnearly two decades has been recreated.
OL,10,FThe Tanfield Railway in Gateshead has
OL,11,Freconstructed the 1940s-built steam
OL,12,Flocomotive No. 68029, 63 years after it
OL,13,Fwas scrapped.
OL,15,FIt was one of nearly 400 steam
OL,16,Flocomotives commissioned to help the
OL,17,Flogistics effort needed to win World
OL,18,FWar Two and went on to support
OL,19,Findustries across the North East after
OL,20,Fhostilities ended. It was scrapped in
OL,21,Fthe 1960s.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
